+## JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386)
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, applies a JSON Merge Patch and returns the
+merged document as a new value; the inputs are never mutated. An object patch merges member by member
+(`null` deletes a member, other values merge recursively); any other patch, arrays included, replaces the
+target. It never throws.
+
 Run the tests with `npm test`.
